        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-13T16:01:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After we write the data here, we can reset `fGradientStorage` and `fGradientOffsetCache` since nothing will be appended anymore from the CPU side.",
