      "parentUuid": "dd800905_8bb73efe",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 524,
        "startChar": 27,
        "endLine": 524,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "3f062c1a5ab071e357bb074d7ab2591c463e98d1",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c211d135_0b54af0a",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/PipelineData.h",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 528,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-13T16:01:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All of this can be consolidated into `std::optional\u003cBindBufferInfo\u003e fBufferInfo`.  If the the buffer info has no value, it\u0027s not finalized yet.  If we finalize the FSM but there was no gradient data, we set it to a default initialized BBI, and otherwise to the BBI that has the uploaded data.  When finalize() can fail there aren\u0027t other cases we need to worry about I don\u0027t think.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 526,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 528,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "3f062c1a5ab071e357bb074d7ab2591c463e98d1",
